#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1310 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "Study type is interventional, so the INTMODEL (Intervention Model) parameter must carry a populated value; TSVAL is empty -> fires on the INTMODEL record. Grouped record_count by STUDYID as on SD1309."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 TSPARMCD=INTMODEL
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | STYPE    | Study Type         | INTERVENTIONAL
S1 | TS | 2 | INTMODEL | Intervention Model |
